@baseUrl = https://localhost:7126
@sourceLocationId = 46599a6f-bc0f-4cf8-b6ad-83e9312a042c
@destinationLocationId = c2727378-b800-4077-b7cf-4541a97af1b1
@productId = ca6f2e9a-24b5-4194-bb2a-66ce34b6a469
@transferId = a2ff920c-b7a8-4728-a686-13f284b68d4a

### Record starting source balance
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/stock/balances?productId={{productId}}&inventoryLocationId={{sourceLocationId}}

### Record starting destination balance
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/stock/balances?productId={{productId}}&inventoryLocationId={{destinationLocationId}}

### Create a NEW draft for this test
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/stock-transfers
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sourceLocationId": "{{sourceLocationId}}",
  "destinationLocationId": "{{destinationLocationId}}",
  "notes": "Return workflow test",
  "lines": [
    {
      "productId": "{{productId}}",
      "quantity": 5,
      "baselineUnitPrice": 7
    }
  ]
}

### Ship
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/stock-transfers/{{transferId}}/ship

### Cannot confirm a return before requesting it
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/stock-transfers/{{transferId}}/confirm-return

### Request return while goods are in transit
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/stock-transfers/{{transferId}}/request-return
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "reason": "The branch cancelled the delivery."
}

### Repeat request — original reason and timestamp are preserved
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/stock-transfers/{{transferId}}/request-return
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "reason": "The branch cancelled the delivery."
}

### Destination receipt must now be blocked
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/stock-transfers/{{transferId}}/receive

### Source stock must still be reduced by 5
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/stock/balances?productId={{productId}}&inventoryLocationId={{sourceLocationId}}

### Confirm all goods arrived back at the source
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/stock-transfers/{{transferId}}/confirm-return

### Repeat confirmation — no additional stock increase
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/stock-transfers/{{transferId}}/confirm-return

### Source stock should be restored
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/stock/balances?productId={{productId}}&inventoryLocationId={{sourceLocationId}}

### Destination stock should be unchanged
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/stock/balances?productId={{productId}}&inventoryLocationId={{destinationLocationId}}

### Check movement history
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/stock/movements?productId={{productId}}&inventoryLocationId={{sourceLocationId}}

### Check final transfer details
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/stock-transfers/{{transferId}}